#% title
# histogram3d

#% text
# `histogram3d([[x, y], ...])` draws counts of points of the plane in the cells of a grid as boxes.

#% section
# Details

#% item
# `histogram3d(data, n, "PDF" | "Probability")` for other heights.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
histogram3d(table([sin(k), cos(2 * k)], k, range(1, 300)))
